    "text": "By MARGARET BAKER, SUN HERALD ,\n14 hours ago Gulfport police are investigating after two people were shot and killed and a third wounded in what appears to be a targeted attack at a Walmart store, Gulfport Police Lt. Jason DuCré said. The shooting happened around 1:30 p.m. Tuesday near the gas pumps at the Walmart Neighborhood Market... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 5",
